<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to Redress Compliance</title>
  <style>
    body, table, td, a { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f5f7; }
    @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {
      .email-container { width: 100% !important; }
      .content-padding { padding: 20px !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f5f7;">
  <center style="width:100%; background-color:#f4f5f7;">
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background-color:#f4f5f7;">
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 20px 0;">
          <table class="email-container" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="600" align="center" style="margin:auto;">

            <!-- Header -->
            <tr>
              <td style="background-color:#002B5C; padding:30px 40px; text-align:center;">
                <span style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:18px; font-weight:700; color:#ffffff; letter-spacing:3px; text-transform:uppercase;">REDRESS COMPLIANCE</span>
                <div style="width:60px; height:2px; background-color:#B8860B; margin:8px auto 0;"></div>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Body -->
            <tr>
              <td class="content-padding" style="background-color:#ffffff; padding:40px;">
                <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
                      <h1 style="font-size:22px; color:#002B5C; margin:0 0 20px;">Welcome Aboard!</h1>
                      <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 15px;">
                        Hi <%= name %>,
                      </p>
                      <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 15px;">
                        Your subscription to the Redress Compliance newsletter is now confirmed. You'll receive our expert analysis on enterprise software licensing directly in your inbox.
                      </p>
                      <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 15px;">
                        Here's what you can expect:
                      </p>
                      <ul style="font-size:15px; color:#555; line-height:1.8; padding-left:20px; margin:0 0 20px;">
                        <li>Deep analysis of licensing changes from major vendors</li>
                        <li>Cost optimization strategies for enterprise software</li>
                        <li>Vendor negotiation tips and best practices</li>
                        <li>Compliance updates and audit readiness insights</li>
                      </ul>
                      <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555; line-height:1.6; margin:0;">
                        Thank you for trusting Redress Compliance as your advisory partner.
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <tr>
              <td style="background-color:#002B5C; padding:25px 40px; text-align:center;">
                <p style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin:0 0 5px;">
                  Redress Compliance LLC | Independent Enterprise Software Licensing Advisory
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin:0 0 10px;">
                  1314 E Las Olas Blvd, Fort Lauderdale, FL 33301
                </p>
                <p style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px; margin:0;">
                  <a href="<%= unsubscribeUrl %>" style="color:#B8860B; text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a>
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </center>
</body>
</html>
